 up for a pottery class Friday nights, which was our night, and I stood in the kitchen and told her it sounded like a good idea","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":44,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":6.605142739681047E-5,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6}],"relationId":"6b03f2896438f403db4d1566","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795420809373,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:00:09","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f2786438f403db4d1558","chatId":"5fef7b353c9744d2890c3ab497d88476","sessionId":null,"userId":130564,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That's a lonely picture — her waiting, and you standing there empty. What do you imagine she'd make of the silence, if you let it be there?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That's a lonely picture — her waiting, and you standing there empty. What do you imagine she'd make of the silence, if you let it be there?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4138,"promptToken