t ahead of","My temper mostly. It's shorter than it used to be. I put my hand through a cabinet door a few weeks back and that's not like me","I don't really know. That's the part I can't get a handle on, it wasn't about the thermostat","I still can't explain it. I'd sit down to open it and end up in the garage instead","That I don't actually want it. That I've been telling people for years I wanted this and if I sit the exam and I still don't want the job, then what was all of it for","That it was never mine to begin with","I'd have nothing to say. That's what scares me"]},"conversation":{"type":"自我认知与成长","topic":"探索长期压抑的自我需求、职业目标与身份认同的冲突，以及由此引发的情绪失控"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f26f6438f403db4d154d","chatId":"5fef7b353c9744d2890c3ab497d88476","sessionId":null,"userId":130564,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"So the garage and the sharpness both do the same job — they get you out of the room before the question lands. What do you think would happen if you stayed in the kitchen a minute longer?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"So the garage and the sharpness both do the same job — they get you out of the room before the question lands. What do you think would happen if you stayed in the kitchen a minute longer?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2596,"promptTokens":1515,"completionTokens":62,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-23 15:59:43"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":41,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"31e8a71aaa9245bbb1c714580543dc96","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694904916422322,"emotions":[],"relationId":