. And it stopped being about the test a while back. Now I can't even sit in my own kitchen and say what I want for the next ten years","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"c17959426aab4f1881fa72b00df701b7","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":9.11037657027749E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":6,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b03f2676438f403db4d1544","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795420775633,"createTime":"2026-11-23 15:59:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["困扰","失控","自责","恐惧","迷茫"],"originalText":["having some trouble at home i can't seem to get ahead of","My temper mostly. It's shorter than it used to be. I put my hand through a cabinet door a few weeks back and that's not like me","I don't really know. That's the part I can't get a handle on, it wasn't about the thermostat","I still can't explain it. I'd sit down to open it and end up in the garage instead","That I don't actually want it. That I've been telling people for years I wanted this and if I sit the exam and I still don't want the job, then what was all of it for","That it was never mine to begin with","I'd have nothing to say. That's what scares me"]},"conversation":{"type":"自我认知与成长","topic":"探索长期压抑的自我需求、职业目标与身份认同的冲突，以及由此引发的情绪失控"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consulta